### API_ISLAM - Interactive HTTP Test File
### Use this file with the "REST Client" extension in VS Code / JetBrains to test endpoints with 1 click!

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### ================= QURAN & AUDIO =================

### 2. Get All 9 Supported Qiraat & Riwayat (KFGQPC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/editions

### 3. Get All Quran Surahs
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/surahs

### 4. Get Surah Al-Fatiha in Hafs (ID: 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/surah/1?edition=hafs

### 5. Get Surah Al-Fatiha in Warsh
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/surah/1?edition=warsh

### 6. Get Surah Al-Fatiha in Qaloon
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/surah/1?edition=qaloon

### 7. Get Verses on Page 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/page/1?edition=hafs

### 8. Get Verses in Juz 30
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/juz/30?edition=hafs

### 9. Search Quran Verses (e.g. "الرحمن")
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/search?q=الرحمن&edition=hafs

### 10. Get Available Quran Reciters
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/reciters

### ================= TAJWEED ENGINE =================

### 11. Get All 18 Tajweed Rules & Colors Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/tajweed/rules

### 12. Get Character Annotations for Al-Fatiha (Ayah 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tajweed/ayah/1/1

### 13. Get Pre-Rendered Color-Coded HTML for Ayah (Surah 1, Ayah 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tajweed/ayah/1/1/html

### 14. Get All Tajweed Annotations for Surah Al-Fatiha
GET {{baseUrl}}/tajweed/surah/1

### ================= PRINTED MUSHAF & IMAGES =================

### 15. Stream High-Res Page 1 Image (Direct File)
GET {{baseUrl}}/mushaf/page/1/image?edition=hafs

### 16. Get Page 1 Image for Warsh
GET {{baseUrl}}/mushaf/page/1/image?edition=warsh

### 17. Get Page 1 Image for Tajweed
GET {{baseUrl}}/mushaf/page/1/image?edition=tajweed

### 18. Get High-Resolution Page Metadata (Page 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/mushaf/page/1?edition=hafs

### 19. Get All Printed Mushaf Editions
GET {{baseUrl}}/mushaf/editions

### 20. Get All 10 Qira'at and 20 Authentic Riwayat
GET {{baseUrl}}/mushaf/riwayat

### ================= TAFSIR (EXPLANATIONS) =================

### 11. Get Available Tafsir Books Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/tafsir/books

### 12. Get Tafsir Al-Muyassar for Surah Al-Fatiha (Surah 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tafsir/ar-muyassar/surah/1

### 13. Get Tafsir for a Specific Ayah (Surah 1, Ayah 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tafsir/ar-muyassar/ayah/1/1

### ================= QIBLA DIRECTION =================

### 14. Calculate Qibla Direction for Tunis
GET {{baseUrl}}/qibla/calculate?latitude=36.8065&longitude=10.1815

### 15. Calculate Qibla Direction for Paris
GET {{baseUrl}}/qibla/calculate?latitude=48.8566&longitude=2.3522

### ================= HIJRI CALENDAR & EVENTS =================

### 16. Get Today's Hijri Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/hijri/today

### 17. Convert Gregorian Date to Hijri (e.g. 2026-09-24)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hijri/convert?date_str=2026-09-24

### 18. Get Islamic Events & Holidays Calendar
GET {{baseUrl}}/hijri/events?year=1448

### ================= LIVE QURAN RADIOS =================

### 19. Get All Live Quran Radio Stations
GET {{baseUrl}}/radios

### 20. Filter Radios by Reciter
GET {{baseUrl}}/radios?category=reciter

### ================= ADHKAR & DUAS =================

### 21. Get Adhkar Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/adhkar/categories

### 22. Get Morning Adhkar
GET {{baseUrl}}/adhkar/category/morning

### 23. Get Random Dhikr
GET {{baseUrl}}/adhkar/random

### ================= HADITH =================

### 24. Get Hadith Collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/hadith/collections

### 25. Get 40 Nawawi Hadiths
GET {{baseUrl}}/hadith/collection/nawawi40

### 26. Get Random Hadith
GET {{baseUrl}}/hadith/random

### ================= PRAYER TIMES =================

### 27. Calculate Prayer Times (Tunis Coordinates)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prayer-times/calculate?latitude=36.8065&longitude=10.1815&timezone=1&method=EGYPT
